"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: これは私が決めたことなの！
#. JA:   もうアナタには関係ないでしょう？私の好きにさせて！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_00"
msgid ""
"I've already decided.\n"
"This doesn't have anything to do with you anymore!\n"
"Let me do as I want...!"
msgstr ""
"Це моє рішення! Тебе це більше не стосується, правда? Дай\n"
"мені чинити як хочу!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: まてライチ、私の話を聞け……くっ、行ってしまったか。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_01"
msgid ""
"Wait, Litchi, listen to me...\n"
"Haah...she's left."
msgstr "Зачекай, Лічі, вислухай мене... Кх, пішла."

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ちょっとまったあああああああああああああああ！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_02"
msgid "Waaaaait a minuuuuuuuuuuuuuuute!"
msgstr "Стрива-а-а-а-а-а-а-ай!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ん、何だ貴様？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_03"
msgid "Hm? Who are you?"
msgstr "Гм? Ти хто?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: い、い、い、今お主、こ、こ、こ、ここで麗しの……否、
#. JA:   か弱き女性に乱暴をはたらこうとしていたでござござござるな！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_04"
msgid ""
"You were harassing that goddess, uh, eh, delicate woman\n"
"just now, weren't you?"
msgstr ""
"Т-т-т-ти щойно хотів скривдити цю чарівну... ні, тендітну\n"
"жінку, так?!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 女性？ああ、ライチのことか。
#. JA:   少し話をしていただけだ。貴様には関係なかろう。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_05"
msgid ""
"Woman? Oh, you mean Litchi? We were just talking.\n"
"That's not really any of your business."
msgstr ""
"Жінку? А, ти про Лічі. Ми лише розмовляли. Це тебе не\n"
"стосується."

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: き、き、き、きっしゃああん！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_06"
msgid "D-D-Damn youuuuuuuuuuuu!"
msgstr "Т-т-т-ти-и-и-и-и!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ライチ殿を呼び捨てにするだと！許さん許さん許さんでござる～！
#. JA:   お天道様が許してもこのバングが許さんでござる！！！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_07"
msgid ""
"How dare you refer to her as simply \"Litchi\"! That is \n"
"waaaaay beyond unacceptable! Even if the goddess \n"
"forgives your rude behavior, I won't!"
msgstr ""
"Як ти смієш називати пані Лічі просто на ім’я?! Не\n"
"пробачу, не пробачу, не пробачу! Навіть якщо саме небо\n"
"простить, Банґ Шініґамі — ні!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 決めた今決めたここで決めた！お主、悪党決定！大決定！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_08"
msgid ""
"I've just decided! Ohhhh, yes I have!\n"
"From now on, you're a villain!"
msgstr ""
"Вирішено! Щойно, тут і зараз! Ти — лиходій! Остаточно й\n"
"безповоротно!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: お主の罪は明白でござる！その証拠にライチ殿の恐れ慄く態度が
#. JA:   全てを物語っていたでござる～～～～！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_09"
msgid ""
"Your fault is obvious! Miss Litchi's frightened expression\n"
"says it all!"
msgstr ""
"Твоя провина очевидна! Перелякана поведінка пані Лічі\n"
"— незаперечний доказ!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ……すまん、行っていいか？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_10"
msgid "...Can I just... go?"
msgstr "...Пробач, можна я піду?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: お主は敵だ！全世界の女性の敵だ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_11"
msgid ""
"You're the enemy!\n"
"The enemy of every woman in the world!"
msgstr "Ти ворог! Ворог усіх жінок світу!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: カグツチの愛と平和とか弱き女性を護る男
#. JA:   「シシガミ＝バング」ここに見参！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_12"
msgid ""
"But fear not! The protector of love, peace, and the\n"
"delicate women of Kagutsuchi, Bang Shishigami, is here!"
msgstr ""
"Захисник любові, миру й тендітних жінок Каґуцучі — Банґ\n"
"Шішіґамі! До бою!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 歯を喰いしばれ～い！今すぐ星の彼方にぶっ飛ばす！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_13"
msgid "Prepare yourself! I will send you flying across the galaxy!"
msgstr "Стисни зуби-и-и! Зараз відправлю тебе за обрій зірок!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: お前、とりあえず人の話を聞け。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_14"
msgid "Do you ever listen?"
msgstr "Ти хоча б вислуховуєш інших?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ゼハァゼハァ、な、なかなかやるでござるな！敵ながら天晴れ。
#. JA:   だが、拙者のほうがわずかに上だったようだっ！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_15"
msgid ""
"Haah... Haah... Y-You're quite a fighter! I'm impressed.\n"
"But...it looks like I was still better than you!"
msgstr ""
"Ха... ха... Н-непогано б’єшся! Ворога гідно похвалити. Та я\n"
"все ж був дещо сильніший!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN01_16
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: わかったわかった、お前の勝ちだ。では私は行くぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN01_16"
msgid ""
"All right, all right. You win.\n"
"Can I go now?"
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд. Твоя перемога. Тепер я піду."

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: おう、そこのむさい人！
#. JA:   「らぐにゃ」ってだいあくとー知らにゃい？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_00"
msgid ""
"Hey, you scruffy guy over there!\n"
"Do you happen to know of the great villain named\n"
"\"Rawrgna\"?"
msgstr ""
"Гей, кудлатий дядьку! Ти не знаєш великого лиходія на\n"
"ім’я «Раґня»?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: むむ、「ラグナ」とな！
#. JA:   確かに拙者も「ラグナ」という大悪党を追っているでござるが、
#. JA:   よもや！お主も大悪党ラグナを成敗する所存か！？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_01"
msgid ""
"Did you just say Ragna!? I'm also after the villain named\n"
"Ragna, but are you...are you also trying to bring him to\n"
"justice!?"
msgstr ""
"Ти сказала «Раґна»?! Я теж полюю на великого лиходія\n"
"Раґну... Невже й ти збираєшся його покарати?!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: おー！そうにゃむさい人！タオは「らぐにゃ」つかまえるニャ！！
#. JA:   で、いっぱいオカネ……
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_02"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, scruffy man! Tao will catch Rawrgna!\n"
"And I'll get tons of money..."
msgstr ""
"Ага, кудлатий дядьку! Тао спіймає «Раґню»! І отримає\n"
"купу грошей..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: おおおおおおおそうであったか！！
#. JA:   お主も世にはびこる悪を許せぬ咎追いであったか！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_03"
msgid ""
"Ohhhhh! Is that right!?\n"
"You are also a vigilante who despises evil!"
msgstr ""
"О-о-о! То ти теж мисливиця за головами, яка не терпить\n"
"зла, що заполонило світ?!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: で、お主、咎追いになってどのくらいになるでござるか？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_04"
msgid "Have you long been...a vigilante?"
msgstr "І давно ти стала мисливицею за головами?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ん～～～、２回寝たぞ、むさい人！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_05"
msgid "Hmmmmm... Since about two nights ago, scruffy man."
msgstr "М-м-м... Тао вже двічі поспала, кудлатий дядьку!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ３日目かよ！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_06"
msgid "This is only your third day!?"
msgstr "То в тебе лише третій день?!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ならば聞いて驚け！階層都市カグツチにその名を轟かす
#. JA:   最強の咎追いにして夢と希望を守る使者、
#. JA:   「シシガミ＝バング」てぇ～のは拙者のことよ！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_07"
msgid ""
"Oh-ho! The strongest and most well-known vigilante in\n"
"the Hierarchical City of Kagutsuchi... The protector of\n"
"hopes and dreams, Bang Shishigami! And, that's me!"
msgstr ""
"Тоді слухай і дивуйся! Наймогутніший і найславетніший\n"
"мисливець за головами в ієрархічному місті Каґуцучі,\n"
"захисник мрій і надій — Банґ Шішіґамі! Це я!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: でだ、ぺぇぺぇの新米であるお主に、
#. JA:   この大先輩がじきじきに稽古をつけてやろう！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_08"
msgid ""
"Since you're an inexperienced rookie, I'll be happy to give\n"
"you a lesson myself!"
msgstr ""
"А тобі, зеленій новачці, я, бувалий мисливець, особисто\n"
"дам урок!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 別にむさい人といわれて怒っているわけではないでござるよ～、
#. JA:   ははは、全身全霊全力をもって相手してやるから
#. JA:   かかってくるがいいでござるよ～。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_09"
msgid ""
"It's not that I'm mad at you for calling me scruffy.\n"
"Heheheh. I'm not going easy on you, so get ready!"
msgstr ""
"Я зовсім не серджуся, що ти назвала мене кудлатим!\n"
"Ха-ха-ха! Битимуся з тобою всіма силами, тож нападай!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: にゃはは！た～のしかったニャ！
#. JA:   また遊んでほしいのネ、むさい人！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_10"
msgid ""
"Meowhaha! It was fun, meow!\n"
"Let's do this again sometime, scruffy man!"
msgstr ""
"Ня-ха-ха! Було весело, няв! Пограймося ще якось,\n"
"кудлатий дядьку!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……新米の癖に、ハァ……やるではないか。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_11"
msgid "Haah, haah...for a rookie...haah...you're not bad at all."
msgstr "Ха... ха... Хоч ти й новачка... ха... але б’єшся непогано."

#. Key: ArcEveBN02_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: だが、ハァ……まだまだ、ハァ……青いでござるよ……
#. JA:   では、拙者は急いでいるのでまた今度……ゼェ、ゼェ……。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN02_12"
msgid ""
"But, haah...you still, haah...have a lot to learn...\n"
"All right, I have to get going. See you around...haah..."
msgstr ""
"Але, ха... тобі ще... ха... багато чого вчитися. А мені треба\n"
"поспішати, тож продовжимо іншим разом... ха..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: むう、ここはどこだ？なにやらタダならぬ雰囲気でござる。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_00"
msgid "Eh? What is this place? What's going on here?"
msgstr "Хм, де це я? Тут панує якась зловісна атмосфера."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 大悪党ラグナが図書館にいると踏んで、やってきたはよいものの
#. JA:   まさか図書館の地下にこのような巨大施設があるとは……
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_01"
msgid ""
"I came here thinking the villain Ragna might appear.\n"
"I never expected that the Library would have a basement\n"
"like this..."
msgstr ""
"Я прийшов, гадаючи, що великий лиходій Раґна\n"
"з’явиться в Бібліотеці, та не сподівався знайти під нею\n"
"таку величезну споруду..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: きゃつらめ、一体何を企てているでござるか！？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_02"
msgid "They must be up to no good."
msgstr "Що ж вони тут замислили?!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: のう、お主もそう思わぬか？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_03"
msgid "Don't you agree with me, stranger?"
msgstr "Гей, ти теж так думаєш?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ほう、私の気配を感じ取るか。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_04"
msgid "Hmmm. So you can sense me?"
msgstr "Хм. Отже, ти відчув мою присутність."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: かように静寂な場所ではさすがに気配を消しきれぬであろう。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_05"
msgid "In a place this quiet, it's hard to be stealthy."
msgstr ""
"У такому тихому місці неможливо цілком приховати свою\n"
"присутність."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 申し遅れた、拙者シシガミ＝バングと申す、
#. JA:   お主は――図書館、ごにょごにょ……いや統制機構の者か？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_06"
msgid ""
"Let me introduce myself. My name is Bang Shishigami.\n"
"Are you from the Library—er, the Librarium?"
msgstr ""
"Пробач, що не представився раніше. Я — Банґ Шішіґамі. А\n"
"ти з Бібліотеки... е-е... ні, з Організації контролю?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 私の名はハクメン。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_07"
msgid "My name is Hakumen."
msgstr "Моє ім’я — Хакумен."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ！？　　なるほど、かの英雄と同名なのでござるな！
#. JA:   驚かせないでほしいでござるよ～。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_08"
msgid ""
"I see. You just happen to have the same name as one of \n"
"the Six Heroes, huh? You scared me for a second there."
msgstr ""
"?! Зрозуміло, ти просто тезка одного із Шістьох Героїв! Не\n"
"лякай мене так!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 否、後にも先にもハクメンは私唯一人だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_09"
msgid "Incorrect. There is only one Hakumen, and I am he."
msgstr "Ні. Хакумен був і буде лише один — я."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 拙者を馬鹿にするのもいい加減にするでござる！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_10"
msgid "How dare you mock me!"
msgstr "Годі з мене глузувати!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: その不可思議な面に警戒をしていたが正解のようであったな。
#. JA:   古の大英雄の名を騙るなぞ笑止千万！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_11"
msgid ""
"I was alarmed by your strange mask, and I was right!\n"
"You should be ashamed of yourself for pretending to be\n"
"one of the ancient heroes!"
msgstr ""
"Недарма мене насторожила твоя дивна маска!\n"
"Привласнювати ім’я великого героя давнини — нечуване\n"
"нахабство!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ふっ、”相変わらず”だな。
#. JA:   良いだろう、貴様の正義示して見るが良い。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_12"
msgid ""
"Hmph, you haven't changed at all.\n"
"Fine. Why don't you show me your justice?"
msgstr ""
"Хм, ти анітрохи не змінився. Гаразд. Покажи мені свою\n"
"справедливість."

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: カグツチの真実と勇気を守る使者！
#. JA:   どんな逆境にも負けない男「シシガミ＝バング」！ここに見参！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_13"
msgid ""
"The protector of the truth and courage of Kagutsuchi! \n"
"The man who will never give in to adversity, Bang\n"
"Shishigami! Here I come!"
msgstr ""
"Захисник правди й відваги Каґуцучі! Муж, який не\n"
"скориться жодним випробуванням, — Банґ Шішіґамі! До\n"
"бою!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 古の大英雄の名を騙る不届き者め！成敗してくれる！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_14"
msgid ""
"Outrageous liar who uses the name of one of the ancient\n"
"heroes, be prepared to be brought to justice!"
msgstr ""
"Негіднику, що привласнив ім’я великого героя давнини!\n"
"Я тебе покараю!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_15"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_16
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_16"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_17
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_17"
msgid "Gah, how dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN03_18
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 卑怯者め、逃げるかあああ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN03_18"
msgid "You sneaky bastard! You can't get away from meeeee!"
msgstr "Боягузе! Стояти-и-и-и!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ほう、悪の中枢の真打登場でござるか！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_01"
msgid ""
"Hmmm, this must be the final boss, the most evil one of\n"
"them all."
msgstr "Ого, нарешті з’явився головний осередок зла!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_02"
msgid "Target recognized. Auto-mode: activated."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: だが、拙者は絶対に負けぬでござる！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_03"
msgid "But I will never give in!"
msgstr "Та я нізащо не програю!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を障害と認識
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_04"
msgid ""
"Scanning complete. IFF determined. Processing...\n"
"Subject determined to be hostile..."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"дозволено... Ціль визначено як перешкоду."

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: なぜならそれは……拙者が「正義」だからだ！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_05"
msgid "Because...I am...justice!"
msgstr "Бо... я і є справедливість!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_06"
msgid "Begin termination."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: カグツチの自由と正義を守る使者！
#. JA:   愛の為に生きる男「シシガミ＝バング」ここに見参！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_07"
msgid ""
"The protector of freedom and justice of Kagutsuchi!\n"
"The man who lives for love, Bang Shishigami! \n"
"Here I come!"
msgstr ""
"Захисник свободи й справедливості Каґуцучі! Муж, який\n"
"живе заради любові, — Банґ Шішіґамі! До бою!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 悪の中枢統制機構、いざ、覚悟～～～～～～～～！！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_08"
msgid "Prepare yourself, villain! You bastaaaard!"
msgstr "Осередку зла, Організаціє контролю, готуйся-я-я-я!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN04_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 何じゃこりゃああああああああああああぁぁぁぁぁ～～～
msgctxt "ArcEveBN04_09"
msgid "What the hell is thaaaaaaat!?"
msgstr "Що це за чортівня-а-а-а-а-а?!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: お頭、ここにいましたか。お探ししました。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_00"
msgid "There you are, Master. I was looking everywhere for you."
msgstr "Босе, ось ви де. Ми вас усюди шукали."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 何事でござるか？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_01"
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr "Що сталося?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_02_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 例の重犯罪者「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」なる者が
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_02_0"
msgid "We just received word that a man who looks like the wanted"
msgstr ""
"Надійшла звістка, що небезпечний злочинець на ім’я\n"
"«Раґна Бладедж»"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_02_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: このカグツチに現れたとの報せがありました。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_02_1"
msgid "criminal, Ragna the Bloodedge, has just showed up in town."
msgstr "з’явився тут, у Каґуцучі."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 噂には統制機構にただ一人で戦いを挑む男と聞いているでござる。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_03"
msgid "Hah...The rumor is that he's taking on the Library all by himself."
msgstr ""
"За чутками, він сам-один кинув виклик Організації\n"
"контролю."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: しかしそれが真実だとすれば、大悪党とはいえ、なかなか骨のある者でござるな……
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_04"
msgid "If that's true, he's a pretty impressive adversary for a villain."
msgstr ""
"Якщо це правда, то хоч він і великий лиходій, мужності\n"
"йому не бракує..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: で、その「ラグナ」は今どこに？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_05"
msgid "So, where is Ragna now?"
msgstr "То де зараз цей «Раґна»?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 申し訳ありません、奴もなかなかの曲者でして
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_06_0"
msgid "Unfortunately, he's a sneaky one..."
msgstr "Перепрошуємо. Він неабиякий хитрун..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 忍びの力及ばず、細かい消息までは掴めておりません。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_06_1"
msgid "None of our ninjas have been able to verify his whereabouts yet."
msgstr ""
"Навіть наших умінь нінджя не вистачило, щоб точно\n"
"встановити його місцеперебування."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: むむ、そうでござるか。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_07"
msgid "Hmmm...is that right?"
msgstr "Хм, ось воно як."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: いかがいたしますか？
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_08"
msgid "What's your plan now?"
msgstr "Що накажете робити?"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_09_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 噂通りの大悪党ならば、野放しにしてはおけぬ。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_09_0"
msgid "If he's as vicious as they say, we can't let him remain at large."
msgstr ""
"Якщо він і справді такий великий лиходій, не можна\n"
"лишати його на волі."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_09_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 拙者が参ろう。お主らは万が一に備えここに残るでござる。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_09_1"
msgid "I'll go take care of him. The rest of you stay here, just in case."
msgstr ""
"Я вирушу сам. А ви лишайтеся тут на випадок\n"
"непередбаченого."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Subordinate
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 御意。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_10"
msgid "Sir!"
msgstr "Слухаємося."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_11_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 麗しの君よ……
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_11_0"
msgid "My goddess..."
msgstr "О моя прекрасна пані..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_11_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: あなたが住まうこの街の平和は、このシシガミ＝バングが命に代えても護りますゆえ
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_11_1"
msgid "I, Bang Shishigami, will protect the peace of your town with my life."
msgstr ""
"Я, Банґ Шішіґамі, захищатиму мир у місті, де ви живете,\n"
"навіть ціною власного життя."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_11_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: ご安心くだされ。
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_11_2"
msgid "You don't need to worry about a thing."
msgstr "Тож не турбуйтеся ні про що."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_12"
msgid "This world where evil roams free..."
msgstr "Світ, де зло безкарно блукає..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_13_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_13_0"
msgid "Where the tears of the weak"
msgstr "Де сльози слабких"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_13_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_13_1"
msgid "fall unheeded..."
msgstr "лишаються непочутими..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_14"
msgid "In a world filled with cruelty..."
msgstr "У світі, сповненому жорстокості..."

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_15_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_15_0"
msgid "With love, courage, and hope in my heart,"
msgstr "З любов’ю, відвагою та надією в серці"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_15_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_15_1"
msgid "I punish evil with the fist of justice!"
msgstr "я караю зло кулаком справедливості!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_16
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: 拙者の名はシシガミ＝バング！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_16"
msgid "My name is Bang Shishigami!"
msgstr "Ім’я мені — Банґ Шішіґамі!"

#. Key: ArcEveBN05_17
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveBN_ArcEveBN05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveBN.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Bang
#. JA: お呼びとあらば即見参！！
msgctxt "ArcEveBN05_17"
msgid "Where there is evil, there too shall I be!"
msgstr "Варто покликати — і я миттю прибуду!!"
